--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT-PATH DECISION (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt names the output dir `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Dashboard/**`.
That path is NOT in the XcodeGen spec (`apps/apple/project.yml`) and would therefore
never compile or be exercised by the build/test gate. The established home for P7
dashboard parity pages is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/` — where the sibling
`GlancePage` (the same web feature directory) already lives and where `project.yml`
includes the `Sources` group. The page is implemented there so the triad actually
covers it. Navigation registration + the string catalog are edited as the prompt allows.

